OK, so I'm in a general shop in the gnomish mines.  I'm wielding Stormbringer
and have a shield of reflection.  There's me, Annootok, and some other figure
in the shop.  I had just finished off a small mimic and decided to leave the
shop--and accidentally run into...the watch captain!  Oops.  
Minor spoiler:

For those who don't know, Stormbringer doesn't prompt you when you move into
a friendly creature.
I'm also low on HP, and the watch captain is one mean MF'er.  But then:

The watch captain zaps a wand...--More--
The death ray [Death ray??  AAAIIIEEE!!!!] is reflected off your 
  shield...--More--  [Whew....]
The death ray hits the watch captain!  The watch captain is killed! --More--
The death ray bounces! --More--
The death ray hits Annootok!  Annootok is killed!

Sweet....I was beginning to think Loki & Murphy really hated me, or at least
my characters.  :-)  
Now if I can just dust off the other 3 dozen or so watchmen....
